# Trail Pieces

The live game is a reveal photo. A dark plate, color pieces that lock onto it, then the full-color photo. Walk a trail and the tutorial both use that.

- Placement rules live in `:app` `layers/v3` (`RevealSession`, `tryPlace`). The screen is `RevealScreen`.
- The journey (menu, moods, trails, progress) lives in `:journey` and `JourneyScreen`.
- The tutorial coaches that same reveal. It does not have its own placement rules.
- A piece is put back by tapping outside its opaque shape. Do not add a close button.
- The grid trail puzzle, Develop a print, and Snap place are removed. Do not bring them back.

Tests, from `android`:

```bat
.\gradlew.bat :app:testDebugUnitTest :journey:test
```

A new photo is `shared/source/reveal/<id>/`, then `.\tools\finish_reveal.ps1 <id>`.
